After the servos are turned on, press any key to clear the prompt, then press “2” (Medium Jog) or 
“3” (Fast Jog) on the Keyboard to enable the Jog stick. Jog the slide away from the X & Z axis ze ros, but not more than 0.200” away. Note that the control will not allow you to leave the Jog mode 
