once every revolution of the ball screw used to position the slide. The ball screw used on the Omni Turn moves the slide .200” / revolution. So if the slide is positioned within .200” of what we want to 
call HOME and then tell the control to slowly rotate the screw while looking for the single pulse we 
can establish this as an easily repeatable location. This is how HOME is established. For consistency 
and safety, ALWAYS use the zeros on the scales for HOME. 123456789 10 0
